          "to": "Even хэл",
          "note": "Evenki dialects have сэлэ, хэлэ and шэлэ; Negidal, Nanai, Udege сэлэ and Manchu sele keep s. Even ⟨х⟩ and ⟨һ⟩ write /h/; Even has no /x/."
